{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 Swing, fling, and tongue-sling your way through a precision platforming challenge like no other. </strong>  <br><br>Take control of a clumsy frog whose only means of movement is its tongue \u2014 use it as a <strong>grappling hook</strong>, a <strong>slingshot</strong>, and even a <strong>tool</strong> to trigger mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>40 handcrafted levels</strong> split into unique worlds, every stage brings new twists and hazards: shifting gravity, deadly lasers, snowstorms, swinging platforms, and much more. Each world introduces a <strong>core mechanic</strong> and several <strong>side mechanics</strong>, keeping the journey fresh and surprising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect flies, chase medals, and test your reflexes in worlds that demand both precision and creativity. Whether you\u2019re aiming for gold medals or simply trying to survive the chaos, every mistake becomes a lesson.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snowy Mountains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountains may look calm, but sudden blizzards love to send frogs flying. Time your jumps between gusts or get blown back to the pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/9c2eb26476eb4719de1acd8fafef48be.poster.avif?t=1760888057\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/9c2eb26476eb4719de1acd8fafef48be.webm?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/9c2eb26476eb4719de1acd8fafef48be.mp4?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Caverns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your lantern keeps the darkness at bay, but it\u2019s a bit of a scaredy-light. Stray too far and it starts to fade, forcing you to hop back before everything goes pitch black.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/66f5a7614f48abd2dd86dc25dc2b327f.poster.avif?t=1760888057\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/66f5a7614f48abd2dd86dc25dc2b327f.webm?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/66f5a7614f48abd2dd86dc25dc2b327f.mp4?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orbital Station</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity here doesn\u2019t play by the rules \u2014 flip it in any direction with a tap. Just don\u2019t get too dizzy, or you\u2019ll end up tongue-first in a laser.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/1f123ec0b13f1b6c061f3d25b89f06af.poster.avif?t=1760888057\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/1f123ec0b13f1b6c061f3d25b89f06af.webm?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/1f123ec0b13f1b6c061f3d25b89f06af.mp4?t=1760888057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986350?t=1760888057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/94094e05edd8f0f2b6ae5e04ddbf558683b7ea57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760888057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/58896e9e225097ee37f9149ddaf9c0cb191c8f8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760888057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/58896e9e225097ee37f9149ddaf9c0cb191c8f8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760888057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc38 Swing, fling, and tongue-sling your way through a precision platforming challenge like no other. </strong>  <br><br>Take control of a clumsy frog whose only means of movement is its tongue \u2014 use it as a <strong>grappling hook</strong>, a <strong>slingshot</strong>, and even a <strong>tool</strong> to trigger mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>40 handcrafted levels</strong> split into unique worlds, every stage brings new twists and hazards: shifting gravity, deadly lasers, snowstorms, swinging platforms, and much more. Each world introduces a <strong>core mechanic</strong> and several <strong>side mechanics</strong>, keeping the journey fresh and surprising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect flies, chase medals, and test your reflexes in worlds that demand both precision and creativity. Whether you\u2019re aiming for gold medals or simply trying to survive the chaos, every mistake becomes a lesson.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snowy Mountains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountains may look calm, but sudden blizzards love to send frogs flying. Time your jumps between gusts or get blown back to the pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/9c2eb26476eb4719de1acd8fafef48be.poster.a